# Frontend Production Environment Variables
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL — only set this if deploying the frontend separately from the backend.
# In the unified Render deployment (single service), leave this UNSET.
# The frontend will automatically use the same origin (empty string = same domain).
#
# Example (separate backend):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-service.onrender.com
